    "diagnosis": "Gene expression subtypes in lung adenocarcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Gene expression subtypes integrated with genomic alterations and clinical and pathological features {25079552}. To coordinate the naming of the transcriptional subtypes with the histopathological, anatomical, and mutation classifications of lung adenocarcinoma, an updated nomenclature has been proposed: the terminal respiratory unit (formerly &ldquo;bronchioid&rdquo;), the proximal inflammatory (formerly &ldquo;squamoid&rdquo;), and the proximal proliferative (formerly &ldquo;magnoid&rdquo;) transcriptional subtypes. CN del, copy-number deletion; expr., expression; mut, mutation.",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted by permission from Nature: Cancer Genome Atlas Research Network. (2014) Comprehensive molecular profiling of lung adenocarcinoma. Nature. 31;511(7511):543-50. PMID: 25079552",
