    "legend": "This invasive non-mucinous adenocarcinoma shows a lepidic architecture at the periphery with tumour cells growing along the existing alveolar framework. The central portion of the tumour (upper left corner on slide) shows invasive adenocarcinoma with acinar and focal papillary architectural patterns and stromal alteration.",
